        "decision": "One-way additive store upgrade. One build per store, no mixed-build writes and no downgrade. SQLite SCHEMA_VERSION stays 6, capsuleSchemaVersion stays 1, event epochs and bundle discriminants stay unchanged. Optional task stage/context, dependent joins, authored knowledge, immutable verification mode and coordinate-bearing settlement verification preserve compiler 5/6/7 absence. Compiler 8 requires complete typed custody and remains disabled until activation. Context UTF-8 bounds are title 256, instructions 8192, acceptance 16 by 2048, path/reference lists 64 by 512, and context plus result contract 24000 serialized bytes. Execute runs gain optional normalized input. Task-completion input requires its coordinate and exact stream/task binding. Input is a finite dense JSON tree, at most 131072 UTF-8 JSON bytes and depth 32. The closed pre-leaf binding uses reserved namespace exarchos.segment-input.v1 and bindingVersion 1, with operationId, streamId, distinct callerDigest/inputDigest, and content-addressed inputRef. Binding limit is 4096 UTF-8 JSON bytes. It uses the existing idempotency_claims table without events, sequence allocation or completion standing. Runtime byte, source-equivalence and graph checks supplement the structural JSON Schema. Historical operation claims and legacy input identities are unchanged.",
